  "title": {
   "en": "Koyoi Anata to Hitamuki Midara"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "今宵あなたとひたむき淫ら"
   },
   {
    "en": "‏ tonight with intense passion and fearless desire by your side"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Anzu Yagihashi is in deep pain after her colleague stole her ex-boyfriend. As if this wound wasn’t enough, she receives an invitation to their wedding, amplifying her suffering and making the pitying and judgmental gazes around her cut even deeper into her heart.\n\nOn her way back from the wedding, she comes across a handsome bartender named Kyohei standing in front of a shop. His charming personality and warm words soothe her broken heart. However, over time, she finds herself confused by his overwhelming kindness, as if their connection might go beyond simple comfort.\n\nDespite her growing attraction to him, Anzu realizes that Kyohei isn’t an ordinary man. He’s dangerous, and if she allows herself to be drawn into his emotions, she might find herself unable to escape."
  },
